{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id37013352"}, "name":{"label":" Kern digraphs—ligature schwas"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-14T08:11:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0"}, "id":{"label":"11492452692"}, "title":{"label":"It’s been a long time…"}, "content":{"label":"But after many years I want to say the work that goes into this app, and the value for money at each subscription level, puts so many developers to shame.\n\nThere is incredible detail available and the flexibility of the layouts in which to view the information in the way it is needed, and to only view what is needed, it feels endless. I have to admit I have lost hours in studying the information I needed – but also lots I didn’t need but was just interested in.\n\nThis is the only app I have ever put a little in the ‘Tip Jar’, and have done on a few occasions, and although I can’t manage a large tip I want to show that I appreciate that the app isn’t just resting on it’s many laurels. There seems to be something new whenever I have time to spend a while exploring – new features, more information and more availability for different parts of the world.\n\n🌈🎉", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
