{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id109541744"}, "name":{"label":"nebraskacity"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-12T03:37:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.12.9"}, "id":{"label":"10685358422"}, "title":{"label":"First experience not great at all"}, "content":{"label":"Update to below review several months later. Based in UK. Perhaps it’s just not great here. About to give up on this app. As I type it is raining and thunder and lightening outside. Carrot (set to my exact postcode) says it is clear and sunny with rain in 50 mins. Repeatedly completely wrong. The other problem is the radar forecast maps which come through as part ‘tiles’ which has meant I’ve never had a usable view of approaching rain or even current conditions via the map. \n\nStill searching for Dark Sky replacement. Brand new to this app but by god it is difficult! I can only see a game / mission and not interested. I really did want the weather and it's not easy to see how to find it. Rip dark sky. This feels like gimmick/scam but will persevere for a bit - not intuitive/new user friendly at all.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
